    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moonriver used to be a quiet town. Now, it's anything but.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a small-town cop thrust into an escalating supernatural crisis. Inspired by \u201880s horror movies and cult shows like <strong>Twin Peaks</strong>, this atmospheric survival shooter features unique mission design, environmental storytelling, and strategic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964690/extras/cb98d1cbc9a41ae3929f93ac6ea6b544.avif?t=1749584791\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Highlights:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Investigate using your detective board \u2014 piece clues together to push the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Open world freedom \u2014 drive, explore, scavenge, and survive however you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic missions \u2014 puzzles, stealth, combat, and everything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Physical interaction \u2014 barricade doors, throw objects, break glass to reach new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Creative survival \u2014 low on ammo? Use stealth or outsmart your enemies.\u00a0<strong>One zombie is no problem, fifteen is a natural disaster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylized hand-drawn graphics and an original dark synth soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964690/extras/d20bb646d601771d6659ef0f3a1faa3d.poster.avif?t=1749584791\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964690/extras/d20bb646d601771d6659ef0f3a1faa3d.webm?t=1749584791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964690/extras/d20bb646d601771d6659ef0f3a1faa3d.mp4?t=1749584791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f \\~5 hours of story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccd 30 km\u00b2 map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Made for fans of narrative-driven indies with heart and bite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
